#: ksecretd/knewwalletdialog.cpp:176
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"No suitable GPG encryption keys were found. To create one, choose one of the "
"following options:<list><item>Install Kleopatra and use it to create a new "
"key. See these <link url='https://docs.kde.org/stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/"
"kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>instructions</link>.</item><item>Open a "
"terminal and enter <command>gpg --full-gen-key</command>.</item><item>Go "
"back and use Blowfish encryption instead, which only requires a password.</"
"item></list>"
msgstr "Fant ingen passende GPG-krypteringsnøkler. Velg ett av disse alternativene for å lage en:<list><item>Installer Kleopatra og bruk det til å lage en ny nøkkel. Se denne <link url='https://docs.kde.org/stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>veiledningen</link>.</item><item>Åpne en terminal og skriv inn <command>gpg --full-gen-key</command>.</item><item>Gå tilbake og bruk Blowfish-kryptering i stedet, som bare krever et passord.</item></list>"

